{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/325631d22c1f0d0272dcbc3bac8773e5.avif?t=1756962758\" data-has-big width=800 height=124 /></span><strong>Collect Your Toothpicks!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Life\u2019s pretty straightforward when you\u2019re a ceramic toothpick holder. But what\u2019s a pig to do in a brand new kitchen? That'll take the help of some new friends and\u00a0a couple well-timed acrobatic feats!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Gameplay Features Overview</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Acrobatic Platforming Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete Missions, Puzzles, Racing, and Platforming Challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features Responsive Tutorials and Visible Input Displays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wholesome and Charming NPC Dialogue Interactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Exciting New Ways to Traverse the Kitchen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a Beautiful Detailed Kitchen Environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu Setting Options, Auto Saving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich Environmental Audio and Dynamic Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Gamepad Controller Support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.poster.avif?t=1756962758\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.webm?t=1756962758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/6e86b06090dc207d39a3c0d50f506e80.mp4?t=1756962758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet Your New Countertop Companions\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This kitchen is full of countertop characters who can't wait to meet the newest arrival! (it's you!)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Culinary World From a Whole New Perspective\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the saying goes, &quot;The world is your toothpick!&quot;- or that's what this piggy toothpick holder tells us (we'll have to fact check him on it).</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Flip, Fling, and Fly Your Way to Daring New Heights!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Begin fun and challenging quests as you meet new friends and discover all new ways to explore the kitchen from top to bottom! After all,\u00a0&quot;There are toothpicks everywhere for those with eyes to see!&quot; (okay, that one can't be true)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.poster.avif?t=1756962758\" width=800 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.webm?t=1756962758\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746980/extras/c496807f1021ed1d761f6f2a02dbcfc6.mp4?t=1756962758\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the History and Inspiration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Usually music is made for the game. This game was made for the music.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This antique pig originates from 1950's Japan, but he more recently became the center of attention among a whole new audience thanks his catchy little jingle written by PineyWoods Corner (for which there is no antidote). Pee Wee's jingle got so popular that it lead to him being placed back into production and is now available at PineyWoodsCorner's shop on Etsy! </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This all struck me as a fun concept [an antique rejoining the modern age], so I created this game for fun and for a good cause! Now Pee Wee taps his trotters to a brand new game made all about him!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Explore the lore!\u00a0a pig game was inspired by PineyWoods Corner's\u00a0Pee Wee Polka Dotted Pig!</i></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Practice Makes Perfect!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/ac39c735d9882c5db8e7d46b960175b28d76429f.jpg"},{"name":"Return to Sender","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/ddc46da46fcfb270701026cdfdc154d065951c7e.jpg"},{"name":"A Breath of Fresh Hare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/51f4ca140357b73e8a90d8b264e54427ac169ed4.jpg"},{"name":"Winning over the Weasel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/da4784a3ef064f663724b4ca9e41b15a97405b68.jpg"},{"name":"New Frontier","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/d6833c9d44231588befc5929fe8def585dd28368.jpg"},{"name":"When Pigs Fly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/ef22324ef3ffed51aedaabe8978f5dac9e6e4de9.jpg"},{"name":"Tony's Trials","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/66dfe30179252fc0fa1666bd8b7be5ee00258b7f.jpg"},{"name":"Iron Pig","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3746980/dacc729168a13152879c86b64fafe75cecdbb555.jpg"},{"name":"Some 